# 20. Linux Shell Scripting Basics

A shell script automates commands.

Example:

```bash
#!/bin/bash

echo "Starting Application"

date

whoami
```

Save:

```text
script.sh
```

Execute:

```bash
chmod +x script.sh

./script.sh
```

